<title>SYRIA: Ssyria sells 25,000 tonnes wheat to Algeria.</title>
<headline>Ssyria sells 25,000 tonnes wheat to Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's general establishment for cereal processing and trade (GECPT) has sold Algeria 25,000 tonnes of hard amber durum wheat for August delivery, a GECPT official told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He did not disclose the price but said the wheat was sold as part of a tender issued by Algeria recently for the purchase of 150,000 tonnes. Partial offers were accepted by Algeria.</p>
</text>
